CM optimize dipole
CM
CM Optimization example
CM Optimization loop is run on the length of the dipole to minimize the VSWR
CM A pause is place in the loop so the animation in the Output window is slowed down
CM A table of SVSWR values vs dipole length is sent to the Output Console.
CE
SY height=12
GW 1,21,0,-y,height,0,y,height,awg14
GE 0
EX 0,1,11,0,1,0
GN -1
FR 0,1,0,0,14,0
RP 0,37,73,1000,0,0,5,5
EN
